dup2 - copy a file descriptor to a specified slot

SYNOPSIS
    int dup2(int oldfd, int newfd);

DESCRIPTION
    Replace newfd with a reference to oldfd. If both refer to the same
    descriptor, leave it in place. Return newfd or -1 on error.

SEE ALSO
    sh(1), execve(2)
